  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support vulnerable internally displaced persons (IDPs) and host communities affe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Result/target 1: Men, women, boys and girls in the affected communities gain fair and equal access to basic social services and community protection structures.  Expected Result/target 2: Access to drinking water, hygiene and sanitation facilities is fairer and more safe and secure for displaced persons and host communities in Daboua and Liwa  Expected Result/target 3: The food and nutritional requirements of hosts and highly vulnerable households are covered and their livelihoods are rebuilt and protected  Expected Result/target 4: An appropriate, effective and well -coordinated multi -sectoral response to all the needs of affected populations, provided by local/national authorities and humanitarian organisations; made possible by advocacy efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
